Looking at this problem, I need to find the minimum cost to connect all n rooms to the Internet. Each room can either be:
1. Connected directly at cost = room_number (1-indexed)
2. Covered by a router placed in a room with a router spot (cost = room_number for router placement)

A router at room j covers range [max(1, j-k), min(n, j+k)].

This is a dynamic programming problem. Let me implement an efficient O(n log n) solution using a segment tree.

